{"title": "Dirt Mound", "pageid": 51948, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dirt_Mound", "categories": ["Gameplay mechanics", "Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dirt-mound.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Dirt-mound.png/300px-Dirt-mound.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Dirt-mound.png/450px-Dirt-mound.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Dirt-mound.png/600px-Dirt-mound.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Dirt-mound.png/300px-Dirt-mound.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"208\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Dirt-mound.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  Example of a dirt mound containing treasure.  </div></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <b>Dirt Mound</b> is a kind of environmental object in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Dirt Mounds can get discovered at various places throughout the game, if a party member succeeds a passive skill check (typically a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Survival Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> or a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perception Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>). When <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dig\" title=\"Dig\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Shovel_Icon.png/25px-Shovel_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Shovel_Icon.png/38px-Shovel_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Shovel_Icon.png/50px-Shovel_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dig\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Shovel_Icon.png/25px-Shovel_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Shovel_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dig\" title=\"Dig\">Dig</a> is used on the dirt mound, a treasure chest appears after an animation showing a few seconds of digging. In order to dig a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shovel_(item)\" title=\"Shovel (item)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Shovel_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shovel_(item)\" title=\"Shovel (item)\">Shovel</a> must be in the inventory of the character performing this action.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_places\">Notable places</span></h2>\n<ul><li>At a house between <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a> and the road to Baldur's Gate, contains an alchemist stash filled with alchemical ingredients intended for <a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald_Thorm\" title=\"Thisobald Thorm\">Thisobald Thorm</a>. The location is marked on the map after reading <a href=\"/wiki/Research_Notes_(Waning_Moon)\" title=\"Research Notes (Waning Moon)\">Research Notes</a> and succeeding a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;14 Intelligence Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;14 <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>. Spotting it without the notes requires a high <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;21 Survival Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;21 <a href=\"/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>.</li>\n<li>At the <a href=\"/wiki/Graveyard_(Lower_City)\" title=\"Graveyard (Lower City)\">Lower City graveyard</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;8&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;24</span>, containing a <a href=\"/wiki/Kobold\" title=\"Kobold\">kobold</a> called <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bugthimble\" title=\"Bugthimble\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Bugthimble.png/25px-Portrait_Bugthimble.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Bugthimble.png/38px-Portrait_Bugthimble.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Bugthimble.png/50px-Portrait_Bugthimble.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bugthimble\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Bugthimble.png/25px-Portrait_Bugthimble.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Portrait_Bugthimble.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bugthimble\" title=\"Bugthimble\">Bugthimble</a></li>\n<li>At the Lower City graveyard at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;17&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;24</span>, containing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gothric_Rillyn\" title=\"Gothric Rillyn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Gothric_Rillyn.png/25px-Portrait_Gothric_Rillyn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Gothric_Rillyn.png/38px-Portrait_Gothric_Rillyn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Gothric_Rillyn.png/50px-Portrait_Gothric_Rillyn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gothric Rillyn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Gothric_Rillyn.png/25px-Portrait_Gothric_Rillyn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_Gothric_Rillyn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gothric_Rillyn\" title=\"Gothric Rillyn\">Gothric Rillyn</a>, who rewards the party in case they dig him up</li>\n<li>At <a href=\"/wiki/Grey_Harbour_Docks\" title=\"Grey Harbour Docks\">Grey Harbour Docks</a> of the Lower City at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-179&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-101</span>, labelled as Pile of Rotten Fish, a unique model, containing a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Key_to_Buried_Treasure\" title=\"Key to Buried Treasure\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/40px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Iron_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Key_Iron_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Key_to_Buried_Treasure\" title=\"Key to Buried Treasure\">Key to Buried Treasure</a> and a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Map_to_Buried_Treasure\" title=\"Map to Buried Treasure\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Book_Note_P_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_P_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Book_Note_P_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_P_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Book_Note_P_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_P_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Book_Note_P_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_P_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Book_Note_P_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Map_to_Buried_Treasure\" title=\"Map to Buried Treasure\">Map to Buried Treasure</a> which leads to another dirt mound containing treasure\n<ul><li>Digging it requires a rare <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Strength Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<ul><li>It is still possible to reveal a dirt mound by using <a href=\"/wiki/Dig\" title=\"Dig\">dig</a> even though the passive skill check has failed.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195605\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2984/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20447/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4932/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1070359/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   56.390      1 -total\n 44.59%   25.147     10 Template:Icon_text\n 42.05%   23.710     42 Template:Trim\n 38.34%   21.620      7 Template:Ability_check\n 36.09%   20.352      1 Template:PageSeo\n 35.05%   19.764      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 32.18%   18.148      3 Template:SmRarityItem\n 26.70%   15.058      3 Template:Item_icon\n 12.86%    7.250     16 Template:Ifempty\n 12.10%    6.826     16 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:51948-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195605 and revision id 373937. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}